  "notes": "Cash basis county, all governmental funds (no enterprise funds). Receipts/disbursements from the Total Governmental Funds column (p4). Taxes 3,863,797 split by the statement of activities general receipts (p2): property 3,627,704 + motor vehicle 185,633 + lodging 50,460 (sum matches). Local 773,189 not split (breakdown only inferable from p2 sums). Roll-forward: 4,553,945 + 6,782,245 - 7,052,744 + 1,671,317 - 1,671,317 + sale of surplus 52,965 = 4,336,411. Sale of surplus recorded in other_financing (printed under other financing sources). Balance sheet from the Statement of Net Position - Cash Basis (p1); label 'Sanitary lanfill' as printed. Detail: General Fund combining statement (p5, three sub-funds) and Road Fund budgetary comparison (p7); the Road Fund budget schedule actual local 95,932 differs from statement local 54,800 because sale of surplus 41,132 is included there. The trimmed PDF's Non-Major combining statement (p6) shows only 6 of the nonmajor fund columns with no Total column (continued on a page not in the trimmed PDF), so nonmajor funds were not recorded in detail. General Fund budget schedule not in trimmed PDF. Read pages 1-7 of 7."
